  "weekly_summary": {
    "items": [
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "The Modern Regional Championship season kicked off this week with the China RC and the first U.S. RC. Esper Goryo’s won the former, while Mono-Green Broodscale Combo won the latter. Use the Tabletop Major Events link above to view detailed statistics and archetype matchup win rates for either event, or combine the two events in a single view.",
          "zh": "本周摩登RC开打，最先开始的是中国RC和第一场美国RC，分别由艾斯波怨灵和纯绿孳巢蜥席卷。点击上方实体大赛的链接可以查看两场赛事的详细统计以及套牌对阵胜率，也可以合并两场赛事一起查看。"
        }
      },
      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "Broodscale Combo’s performance at the U.S. RC stood out from the field. Three copies reached the Top 4, and one of them won the event. The archetype posted an overall win rate of 54%. Looking only at the U.S. event, it had no losing matchup against any of the five most-played archetypes. Calls within the community to ban [[card:Kozilek's Command|Kozilek’s Command]] are also growing louder.",
          "zh": "孳巢蜥组合技在美国RC的战绩有一些鹤立鸡群，四强有三个并最终夺冠。整体胜率高达54%，只看美国这场的话，占比前5的主流对局中甚至没有劣势对局。社区中想要禁掉[[card:Kozilek's Command|寇基雷的指命]]的声音也是越来越大。"
        }
      }
    ],
    "week": "2026-W37"
  }
